// The DCC gate's SOUND face: a Public splice into a string accepts —
// unannotated values default Public and the obligation discharges
// clean. The pair with mn-ifc-splice-leak differs only in the source's
// classification, so the pair is its own control. Expect NO diagnostics.
fn getname() = "morgan"
fn greet() = {
  let name = getname()
  "hello, {name}"
}
fn main() = 0
